{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#card-zh","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 是为 DSH Web 客户端提供局域网访问和窄屏适配的插件。它通过 bundle patch 将 webserver 绑定到 0.0.0.0，并保留既有端口配置；插件代码再借助 webServer 的 tapIndex 钩子处理返回的 index.html。主要功能包括为非安全 HTTP 环境补上 crypto.randomUUID、为 820px 以下屏幕注入紧凑布局样式，以及调整对话框、输入控件和触控按钮。适合在同一局域网的手机或其他设备浏览 DSH Web 界面；无需 API key 或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-19","lib/index.js:27-40","lib/index.js:49-77","lib/index.js:84-88"]}
{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#card-en","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lan-access enables LAN access and a compact mobile layout for DSH Web. Its patch binds the webserver to 0.0.0.0. The plugin injects a crypto.randomUUID fallback and responsive CSS below 820px, adjusting dialogs, inputs, and touch targets for phones and other devices on the same LAN.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-19","lib/index.js:27-40","lib/index.js:49-77","lib/index.js:84-88"]}
