{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#feature-lan-webserver","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「局域网 Web 访问」：把 DSH webserver 的 host 设为 0.0.0.0，并沿用启动配置中的端口（缺省 3080），使服务绑定所有网络接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-12"]}
{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#feature-uuid-fallback","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「randomUUID 兼容」：返回的 HTML 缺少 randomUUID 时，注入脚本以 crypto.getRandomValues 生成 UUID v4 兜底；已包含该关键词的页面不会重复注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-40","lib/index.js:74-78"]}
{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#feature-mobile-layout","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「手机窄屏布局」：在视口宽度不超过 820px 时注入 CSS，压缩对话文字排版、设置输入框和按钮尺寸，并让对话框及菜单适配屏幕。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-72"]}
{"unit_id":"Leon0555__dsh-lan-access#feature-index-hook","repo":"Leon0555/dsh-lan-access","commit":"037fb8a5f6ba7fdd4ab9068f1217edbaaea13aca","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-access 的功能「HTML 注入」：插件等待 webServer 服务后注册 tapIndex，将 polyfill 脚本和移动端样式加入返回页面的 head。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:23-24","lib/index.js:74-88"]}
